<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 133.00 mln rand SAfrica bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 133.00 mln rand SAfrica bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 133.00 million rands worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling 323.67 million on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
